1.17.1: every machine releases complete

release.sh fetches the film library when the machine has none, on both
the release and --restage paths, before the import so that a failed
fetch (no network) stops the release with the repo untouched; a
machine that already has the library is unaffected (fetch_luts.sh
skips present families). A page without films can no longer be
published by accident - the 1.17.0 release from a fresh clone did
exactly that.
